{"id":"418158326","kind":"article","title":"概念抓手（来自 Alexander）","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5vA4vw86DKNq22xt6pRWhumeRmSzwV6hxRHE"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"常青笔记 & 知识工作","date":"2021-10-07","updated":"2022-09-06","votes":19,"comment_count":6,"minutes":2,"chars":783,"keywords":["概念抓手","知识表达","概念命名","思想工具","常青笔记"],"summary":"Andy Matuschak 把“概念抓手”定义为能代表复杂抽象主题、又令人难忘的短语。给模糊想法起一个清晰名称，能让人更容易记住、讨论并用于解决问题；他将其比作概念的 API，帮助不同思想建立连接。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/418158326","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"参考文献"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-3","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"XgopotF2\">「概念抓手」是令人难忘的名词短语，代表一个复杂的、通常是抽象的主题。比如「囚徒困境」、「奥弗顿之窗」、「信仰的信仰 」等等。在我自己的写作中，例子包括<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3DaBP4vN1dutjUgrk3jbEeNxScccvDCxDgXe\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">赋能环境</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3KASfpz5AmNmqM2m517Jbs1EvXrLN7NkeYWH\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情景体验</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>，等等。「概念抓手」是自己的一个概念抓手，由 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z6y6cuKoEnMAJ25ad1fFPqcB3DW1T5jeG9XNu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Scott Alexander</a> 创造的。</p><p data-pid=\"PMqbZ8k4\">成功的概念抓手让模糊的想法更清晰。很多人对这些想法有些大概的理解，但没办法指明，更不要说讨论了。给这种模糊的概念起一个清晰、响亮的名字，能够开启了更多对话与思想的可能。Per Alexander：</p><blockquote data-pid=\"phlrRw2h\">我不大可能会发现那种没人想到过的全新社会现象。但是有很多事情人们都有模糊不清的想法，他们不能完全用语言表达出来。但将这些想法转变为他们可以掌握的、并能与他人讨论的、<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://slatestarcodex.com/2014/03/15/can-it-be-wrong-to-crystallize-patterns/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">水晶般清晰的</a>想法是一件大事。<br/><br/>如果你发现了一些有趣的东西，并非常简短地把它塞进别人的脑子里，不要浪费这个机会！给它一个漂亮的概念抓手，让他们记住它，并能用它来解决其他问题。</blockquote><p data-pid=\"X_y_q5Aw\">可以把概念抓手想成「概念的 API」。在这个意义上，概念抓手便能联系起我的想法：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z3XP5GRmd9z1D2qCE7pxUvbeSVeQuMiqz9x1C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">常青笔记的标题就像 API</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"nFdD1dK_\">问：举一个概念抓手的例子？<br/>答：（囚徒困境，情景体验，等等。）</p><p data-pid=\"FWGDdrgJ\">问：从网络化智能的角度解释为什么概念抓手很重要？<br/>答：人们得以围绕以往模糊不清的想法协调讨论。</p><hr/><h2 id=\"sec-1\">参考文献</h2><p data-pid=\"7g2TdQvC\"><a class=\"external\" href=\"https://slatestarcodex.com/2016/02/20/writing-advice/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"visible\">slatestarcodex.com/2016</span><span class=\"invisible\">/02/20/writing-advice/</span><span class=\"ellipsis\"></span></a></p><h2 id=\"sec-2\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"udgHU6aR\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"413012854\" href=\"#/post/413012854\">怎样用 Anki 理解公式：以统计学为例</a></li><li data-pid=\"XmJVmXlS\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"421908250\" href=\"#/post/421908250\">常青笔记的标题就像 API</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-3\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"_TVg06xg\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"tE-YKvfl\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制 <br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z5vA4vw86DKNq22xt6pRWhumeRmSzwV6hxRHE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Concept handles, after Alexander (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 赋能环境 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"458337989\" href=\"#/post/458337989\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 情景体验 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"463926133\" href=\"#/post/463926133\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 常青笔记的标题就像 API <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"421908250\" href=\"#/post/421908250\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"416319260","title":"常青笔记（Evergreen notes）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":188,"minutes":3,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"420726986","title":"常青笔记应该是原子化的","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 常青笔记 & 知识工作"},{"id":"421908250","title":"常青笔记的标题就像 API","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":23,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"413012854","title":"怎样用 Anki 理解公式：以统计学为例","author":"Eric 'Siggy' Scott","votes":52,"minutes":4,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"463926133","title":"情景体验（Enacted experience）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":20,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[]}